sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Data Scientist
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant MutWH as Mutating Webhook<br/>443/TCP TLS
    participant ValWH as Validating Webhook<br/>443/TCP TLS
    participant Controller as Trainer Controller<br/>controller-runtime
    participant Runtime as Runtime Plugin<br/>(Flux/MPI)
    participant Scheduler as Gang Scheduler<br/>(CoScheduling/Volcano)
    participant JobSet as JobSet Controller
    participant Pods as Training Pods
    participant NetPol as NetworkPolicy Manager
    participant Progression as Progression Monitor

    Note over User,Progression: Training Job Lifecycle

    User->>K8sAPI: kubectl apply TrainJob CR<br/>references TrainingRuntime
    K8sAPI->>MutWH: Admission request (CREATE)
    MutWH->>MutWH: Apply defaults from<br/>TrainingRuntime template
    MutWH-->>K8sAPI: Mutated TrainJob
    K8sAPI->>ValWH: Admission request (CREATE)
    ValWH->>ValWH: Validate TrainJob spec<br/>against runtime constraints
    ValWH-->>K8sAPI: Admission allowed
    K8sAPI-->>User: TrainJob created

    Note over Controller,Progression: Controller Reconciliation

    K8sAPI->>Controller: Watch event: TrainJob created
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Get TrainingRuntime/<br/>ClusterTrainingRuntime
    K8sAPI-->>Controller: Runtime specification

    Controller->>Runtime: Delegate to runtime plugin
    Runtime->>Runtime: Configure framework-specific<br/>resources (ConfigMaps, Secrets)
    Runtime->>K8sAPI: Create ConfigMaps/Secrets<br/>for framework coordination
    Runtime-->>Controller: JobSet spec ready

    Controller->>K8sAPI: Create JobSet CR

    Note over Controller,Progression: Gang Scheduling (if enabled)

    Controller->>Scheduler: Create PodGroup CR
    Note right of Scheduler: CoScheduling: scheduling.x-k8s.io/PodGroup<br/>Volcano: scheduling.volcano.sh/PodGroup
    Scheduler->>K8sAPI: Read PriorityClass
    K8sAPI-->>Scheduler: Priority configuration

    Note over Controller,Progression: RHOAI-Specific Flows

    Controller->>NetPol: Create NetworkPolicy<br/>for TrainJob
    NetPol->>K8sAPI: Create NetworkPolicy CR<br/>per-TrainJob isolation

    JobSet->>K8sAPI: Create training Pods
    K8sAPI-->>Pods: Pods scheduled

    Pods->>Pods: Execute distributed training

    Progression->>K8sAPI: Watch Pod status
    K8sAPI-->>Progression: Pod readiness updates
    Progression->>K8sAPI: Update TrainJob status<br/>(training progression)

    Pods-->>Controller: Training complete
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Update TrainJob status

    Note over Controller,Progression: TLS Configuration (Startup)

    Controller->>K8sAPI: Get config.openshift.io<br/>/v1/apiservers
    K8sAPI-->>Controller: Cluster TLS security profile
    Controller->>Controller: Apply cipher suites to<br/>webhook, metrics, status servers
    Note right of Controller: Fallback: Intermediate profile<br/>(TLS 1.2+, AEAD ciphers)
